       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">SPORTS</span> · BBC Sport · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>BBC Sport launches daily interactive football quizzes</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#sports</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>BBC Sport has introduced a suite of daily football-themed quizzes designed to test fan knowledge. The platform now features three distinct challenges: 'Who Am I?', which uses a clue-based reveal system; 'Five in Five', requiring five correct answers in under five minutes; and a 'Brainteaser' question that limits users to five lives.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/bbc-sport-launches-daily-interactive-football-quizzes.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>These daily interactive segments are curated by Flora Snelson and Joe Rindl. Fans can access the content via the dedicated Football and Sports Quizzes pages on the BBC Sport website, where they may also sign up for notifications to receive updates on new challenges directly to their devices.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: A concise and accurate summary of the source material provided.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
