     <article class="story single" data-beat="world">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">WORLD</span> · News18 World · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Co-Pilot Attempted to Disable Flydubai Controls While Stabbing Pilot, Passenger Reports</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Flydubai</span> <span>#Aviation Safety</span> <span>#Pilot Attack</span> <span>#Benjamin Netanyahu</span></div>
       <p>Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu’s spokesperson, David Mencer, has revealed harrowing details concerning a Flydubai mid-air crash scare, stating that the Omani co-pilot reportedly attempted to damage the aircraft’s controls with his feet while simultaneously stabbing Captain Smit Machchhar, the Indian pilot. These alarming specifics were shared with Prime Minister Netanyahu by a passenger who entered the cockpit amidst the commotion and successfully overpowered the accused, preventing further harm.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/co-pilot-attempted-to-disable-flydubai-controls-while-stabbi.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Speaking on Fox News’ daily news programme ‘The Story’, Mencer elaborated on the co-pilot's actions. He stated that the co-pilot &quot;wasn't sitting in the pilot's chair…He was standing over the controls. He was using his feet to destroy the controls of the aircraft while he was attacking that Indian pilot.&quot; This account paints a grim picture of the struggle that unfolded in the cockpit, highlighting the extreme measures taken by the co-pilot.</p><p>Mencer explicitly stated the co-pilot's clear intent during the incident, confirming that &quot;His objective was to bring down that airplane.&quot; The intervention by the passenger was crucial in averting a potential catastrophe, bringing to light the severe threat posed during the flight. Further investigations are expected to clarify the full sequence of events and the motivations behind the co-pilot's actions.</p><p>What to watch: Further details from ongoing investigations into the co-pilot's motives and the heroics of the intervening passenger.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Faithfully summarizes the harrowing account provided by the spokesperson during the Fox News interview.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/world/flydubai-omani-co-pilot-tried-to-damage-flight-controls-while-stabbing-indian-pilot-smit-machchhar-10363990.html" rel="noopener">News18 World</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-02/co-pilot-attempted-to-disable-flydubai-controls-while-stabbi" data-title="Co-Pilot Attempted to Disable Flydubai Controls While Stabbing Pilot, Passenger Reports"><b>Share:</b>
