      <a href="/feed.xml" title="RSS">RSS</a>
      <button id="tdp-theme" title="Toggle light/dark">Light</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="cricket">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">CRICKET</span> · Crictracker · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Farooqi's Record USD 380,000 Bid Highlights ILT20 Season 5 Auction</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Cricket</span> <span>#ILT20</span> <span>#Auction</span> <span>#Fazalhaq Farooqi</span></div>
       <p>Afghan left-arm pacer Fazalhaq Farooqi became the most expensive player in ILT20 auction history on October 1, 2026, when MI Emirates secured him for USD 380,000 at the Season 5 Player Auction in Dubai. This landmark bid at the ICC Academy Indoors surpassed the previous benchmark of USD 260,000, set by Andre Fletcher for MI Emirates during the Season 4 auction, marking a USD 120,000 increase and underscoring a sharp rise in demand for elite fast bowlers.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/farooqis-record-usd-380000-bid-highlights-ilt20-season-5-auc.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The day was particularly dynamic as the auction record changed hands three times. Gulf Giants initially set a new high by securing Rahmanullah Gurbaz for USD 310,000 via a Right-to-Match card. They then further escalated the bidding, acquiring Liam Livingstone for USD 350,000. However, Farooqi's USD 380,000 hammer price ultimately closed the day as the definitive high-water mark, reflecting MI Emirates' aggressive strategy, which saw them spend a total of USD 2,000,000.</p><p>Beyond the top bids, Dubai Capitals signed Faf du Plessis for USD 300,000, while Gulf Giants added Alzarri Joseph for USD 230,000. MI Emirates also made Muhammad Waseem the highest-priced UAE player, retaining him for USD 210,000 via a Right-to-Match card. Desert Vipers assembled a Pakistan-heavy group, picking up Babar Azam, Naseem Shah, Fakhar Zaman, and Shadab Khan, each at the USD 80,000 base price, with Babar set to make his ILT20 debut.</p><p>What to watch: How these high-value signings impact team dynamics and on-field performance in ILT20 Season 5.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Comprehensive coverage of the auction dynamics, record-breaking bids, and specific player signings as detailed in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/farooqi-shatters-ilt20-auction-record-with-usd-380000-bid-from-mi-emirates-3342/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
