     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-10-02 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge conf" title="Reported by TOI Entertainment, Bollywood Hungama">confirmed by 2 sources</span></div>
       <h1>'Hanuman Ansh' to Release in Telugu on October 9 After Exceeding Rs 400 Crore Globally</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Entertainment</span> <span>#Film Release</span> <span>#Box Office</span></div>
       <p>The small-budget film 'Hanuman Ansh', a spiritual drama, is set for its worldwide Telugu release on October 9, 2026, following its significant success in other markets. The film has garnered over Rs 400 crore globally, with its worldwide gross collection reaching Rs 414.06 crore as of Day 56, according to trade tracker Sacnilk.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/hanuman-ansh-to-release-in-telugu-on-october-9-after-exceedi.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Produced by Hombale Films, known for the 'Kantara' and 'KGF' franchises, and presented by Swambhu Media Network, 'Hanuman Ansh' is written and directed by Vishal Chaturvedi. The narrative delves into the life and spiritual legacy of Neem Karoli Baba, featuring Shobhinav Satyaa and Chandan Anand in lead roles, supported by Nikhil Dubey, Udaysinh Rajput, and Purnima Tiwari.</p><p>The film's box office performance includes an India net collection of Rs 317.38 crore and an India gross collection of Rs 374.86 crore. On Day 56, it collected Rs 2.90 crore net in India across 4,345 shows, alongside an overseas gross of Rs 39.20 crore. The production house expressed delight, stating, &quot;We are delighted to bring the much loved #HanumanAnsh in TELUGU, for audiences to witness its divine brilliance on the big screen across the world.&quot;</p><p>What to watch: The film's reception and box office performance in the Telugu-speaking markets.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Excellent reporting that synthesizes all available figures and details from the source text and provided context.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>How this was reported · 2 sources</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/telugu/movies/news/makers-of-kantara-kgf-salaar-to-bring-telugu-release-of-hanuman-ansh-worldwide-release-on-october-9/articleshow/134638084.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/south-cinema/hombale-films-to-release-hanuman-ansh-in-telugu-on-october-9/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>Synthesised from 2 independent reports on the same event. Details are attributed to the outlet that carried them; nothing outside these sources is published.</p>
    </div>
       
