<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>India Clinches Asian Games 2026 Women's Hockey Gold, Ends 44-Year Wait — The Daily Prompt</title>
<meta name="description" content="India's women's hockey team defeated China 1-0 in the Asian Games 2026 final in Aichi-Nagoya, securing the nation's 16th gold medal at the event. This">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://news.bharatdn.com/article/2026-10-02/india-clinches-asian-games-2026-womens-hockey-gold-ends-44-y">

