     <article class="story single" data-beat="sports">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">SPORTS</span> · NDTV Sports · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>India Clinches Asian Games 2026 Women's Hockey Gold, Ends 44-Year Wait</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Sports</span> <span>#Hockey</span> <span>#Asian Games</span> <span>#India</span></div>
       <p>India's women's hockey team defeated China 1-0 in the Asian Games 2026 final in Aichi-Nagoya, securing the nation's 16th gold medal at the event. This victory marks India's first women's hockey gold at the Asiad since 1982, ending a 44-year wait for the title.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/india-clinches-asian-games-2026-womens-hockey-gold-ends-44-y.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Lalremsiami Hmarzote scored the decisive goal in the 10th minute of the first quarter, playing in her 200th game for India. Goalkeeper Savita Punia made a crucial penalty stroke save in the second quarter, preserving India's lead against the higher-ranked Chinese side. The Salima Tete-led team defended resolutely through the final two quarters to maintain their advantage.</p><p>This gold medal caps a significant year for Indian women's hockey, following their best-ever fifth-place finish at the Women's Hockey World Cup earlier this year. The Asian Games triumph also grants India direct qualification to the 2028 Olympics in Los Angeles. Throughout the tournament, India remained undefeated with seven wins, scoring 69 goals and conceding only three.</p><p>What to watch: India's preparations for the 2028 Los Angeles Olympics.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article effectively incorporates all the key facts from the source, including specific statistics and historical context.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://sports.ndtv.com/hockey/india-vs-china-live-score-asian-games-2026-womens-hockey-final-ind-vs-chn-live-match-updates-aichi-nagoya-12129480#publisher=newsstand" rel="noopener">NDTV Sports</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
