      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-indianapolis-man-quietly-built-a-fortune-exceeding-13-million-after-his-death-a-surprise-call-from-his-estate-brought-a-1-6-million-gift-to-a-charity-supplying-classrooms-with-essential-materials/articleshow/134632883.cms" rel="noopener">Times of India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
