      <ul><li><a href="https://www.engadget.com/2275451/new-mexico-meta-40-billion-penalties-cambridge-analytica-lawsuit/" rel="noopener">Engadget</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
