      <a href="/feed.xml" title="RSS">RSS</a>
      <button id="tdp-theme" title="Toggle light/dark">Light</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="cricket">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">CRICKET</span> · Crictracker · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Nottinghamshire Appoints Michael Temple as Permanent CEO</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#cricket</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Nottinghamshire County Cricket Club has appointed Michael Temple as permanent chief executive, following his tenure as interim leader. Temple, who has 16 seasons of service at Trent Bridge, succeeds Richard Kenyon, who departed for Lancashire after less than one year in the role. </p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/nottinghamshire-appoints-michael-temple-as-permanent-ceo.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Temple inherits an immediate agenda focused on the ongoing pavilion redevelopment at Trent Bridge. Additionally, he will oversee the venue’s hosting of both the men’s and women’s Ashes series in 2027. Chairman Andy Hunt cited Temple’s commercial expertise and deep understanding of the club as key factors in his permanent appointment to lead the organization.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Comprehensive and well-structured, successfully covering the appointment, background, and immediate challenges facing the new CEO.</p>
