      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/nottinghamshire-appoint-michael-temple-as-chief-executive-3693/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
