       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-10-02 · editor 6/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Opposition Protest in Delhi: Over 1,100 Detained at Jantar Mantar</h1>
       
       <p>An opposition protest unfolded in Delhi, with the INDIA bloc leading demands for the Chief Election Commissioner's exit. The demonstration took place at Jantar Mantar, drawing significant participation from opposition groups.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/opposition-protest-in-delhi-over-1100-detained-at-jantar-man.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>During the protest, Delhi authorities detained over 1,100 individuals. The INDIA bloc reiterated its call for the removal of the Chief Election Commissioner amidst the ongoing agitation.</p><p>What to watch: Further developments regarding the INDIA bloc's demands and potential future protests are anticipated.</p>
       
       <div class="provenance">
