     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>PM Modi Commends Pilot Smit Machchhar After Mid-Air Attack</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Prime Minister Narendra Modi spoke with Captain Smit Machchhar on Friday to applaud the pilot's courage during a mid-air emergency. Machchhar, an Indian pilot, sustained serious injuries after being attacked by his co-pilot aboard a Flydubai flight traveling from Dubai to Tel Aviv.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/pm-modi-commends-pilot-smit-machchhar-after-mid-air-attack.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>During their conversation, the captain recounted the incident and discussed the factors that enabled his response to the crisis. Prime Minister Modi praised Machchhar's bravery throughout the ordeal and expressed his well-wishes for the pilot's recovery. The call serves as an official acknowledgment of the pilot's conduct during the life-threatening encounter.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately synthesizes all provided facts from the source text and provides a complete, well-organized news summary.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/pm-modi-speaks-to-flydubai-pilot-smit-machchhar-hails-his-courage-during-mid-air-attack-10363994.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
