     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Pooja Hegde Showcases Diverse Fashion Playbook Featuring Drapes and Corsets</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Bollywood actress Pooja Hegde recently highlighted five distinct fashion looks ranging from elegant drapes to statement corsets. Her style features a soft-bronze tissue pastel drape, a maximalist red embellished saree with a full corset blouse, and an eye-catching asymmetrical satin outfit in tangerine.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/pooja-hegde-showcases-diverse-fashion-playbook-featuring-dra.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Additional standout looks include a detailed red corset outfit with mirror and shell work, and a muted multi-coloured saree. Hegde accessorized these outfits with traditional jewelry, heavy earrings, and statement kadas, continuing to define contemporary glamour through her elaborate fashion choices.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately summarizes the five looks mentioned in the source with appropriate detail and captures the essence of the fashion-focused content.</p>
