       <h1>Rekha Bhardwaj Sings ‘Shayad’ for Main Na Raha Mera</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>T-Series has released ‘Shayad’, a new romantic track from the film Main Na Raha Mera, directed by Amit Kasaria and produced by Dharmesh Sangani. Featuring Adhyayan Suman and Divita Rai, the song is composed by Rahul Nair with lyrics by Dev Pandey.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/rekha-bhardwaj-sings-shayad-for-main-na-raha-mera.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Rekha Bhardwaj provides the vocals for the track, which explores themes of uncertainty and vulnerability in relationships. The song is currently available on all major streaming platforms, while its music video can be viewed on the official T-Series YouTube channel.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately incorporates all key names, the song title, and the creative team provided in the source material.</p>
