       <h1>Ritvik Sahore to portray Aniket Nikam in Prahaar</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Ritvik Sahore will star as Aniket Nikam in the upcoming film Prahaar: The Untold Story of Ujjwal Nikam, portraying the son of the renowned lawyer. The film, which features Rajkummar Rao as Ujjwal Nikam, explores the lawyer's personal life and his role in the courtroom battles following the 26/11 attacks.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/ritvik-sahore-to-portray-aniket-nikam-in-prahaar.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Directed by Avinash Arun and also starring Wamiqa Gabbi and Jaideep Ahlawat, the movie highlights the family support system behind the legal proceedings. Prahaar is scheduled for theatrical release on October 16, 2026. Sahore described the project as an enriching experience and an important story regarding the establishment of justice.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurate and well-summarized. It captures the key casting and plot details while referencing the director and the film's thematic focus on the legal aftermath of 26/11.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/ritvik-sahore-on-playing-ujjwal-nikams-son-in-prahaar-it-was-fun-exploring-anikets-relationship-with-his-father/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
