     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Sachin Kumar Yadav Appointed Managing Director of KFON</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Sachin Kumar Yadav officially assumed the role of Managing Director for the Kerala Fibre Optic Network (KFON) on October 2, 2026. Yadav concurrently serves as the Director of the Kerala State IT Mission and holds additional leadership roles at Technopark and the Kerala State Remote Sensing and Environment Centre.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/sachin-kumar-yadav-appointed-managing-director-of-kfon.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Simultaneously, KFON reached a significant operational milestone by surpassing two lakh connections, totaling 2,00,073 across households, government institutions, and businesses. The network currently spans over 34,505 kilometers and functions through a partnership with approximately 3,800 local network providers.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Draft successfully incorporates nearly all concrete facts, dates, and figures from the source text.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/sachin-yadav-assumes-charge-as-kfon-md/article71537067.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
