       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Sara Gurpal Injured in 'Rise and Fall 2' Task, Clashes Over Verdict</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Entertainment</span> <span>#Reality TV</span> <span>#Controversy</span></div>
       <p>The 'Rise and Fall 2' competition saw a tense turn during a high-intensity Workers task when contestant Sara Gurpal sustained a forehead injury. While aggressively attempting to secure a win for her team by collecting gunpowder, her helmet caused friction, peeling the skin and leaving a visible wound. Despite the pain, Sara continued the physically demanding challenge without pausing for medical intervention until its conclusion, a commitment noted by fellow contestants Niharika and Gautam Gulati.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/sara-gurpal-injured-in-rise-and-fall-2-task-clashes-over-ver.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>However, the Workers were ultimately declared the losers, a decision that did not sit well with Gurpal. She questioned the verdict and its evaluation of her team's efforts, leading to a heated confrontation with the Penthouse contestants. Sara expressed disappointment at their perceived lack of empathy, stating, &quot;They saw the way we were playing the task, and yet they didn’t show any mercy.&quot;</p><p>Her disagreement escalated into a heated exchange with Shehzad Poonawalla, whom Sara accused of a biased decision. This incident has added another layer of tension to the dynamics between the Workers and Penthouse contestants, highlighting the increasingly competitive atmosphere within 'Rise and Fall 2'.</p><p>What to watch: The fallout from the biased decision and its impact on team dynamics.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft covers all facts from the source material accurately, including the specific details of the injury and the resulting confrontations.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/rise-and-fall-2-sara-gurpal-injured-during-workers-task-clashes-with-shehzad-poonawalla-over-biased-verdict/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
