      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/video/karnataka-form-7-row-tamil-nadu-by-poll-battle-and-highway-signage-language-dispute-ytvd-3008028-2026-10-02?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
