     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Swara Bhasker Recalls Disturbing Filmmaker Encounter on Reality Show</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Swara Bhasker</span> <span>#Rise and Fall Season 2</span> <span>#Filmmaker Misconduct</span> <span>#Bollywood</span></div>
       <p>Actress Swara Bhasker, currently a participant on Amazon Prime Video and MX Player's &quot;Rise and Fall Season 2,&quot; recently shared a distressing experience she faced after being cast as a leading lady in a film. Speaking with fellow contestants, Bhasker detailed an incident that occurred &quot;just after Tanu Weds Manu,&quot; a film she described as her &quot;big lead film,&quot; for a project requiring a 56-day shoot.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/swara-bhasker-recalls-disturbing-filmmaker-encounter-on-real.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Bhasker recounted that the filmmaker initially sent her poetry about her appearance, asserting that directors must &quot;love their actors.&quot; A pivotal moment arose during a romantic scene rehearsal when the director insisted on practicing privately with her. Bhasker refused, requesting the presence of the actor and cameraperson, noting she was the &quot;only woman at the guesthouse.&quot; She later observed the director and cinematographer drinking, stating, &quot;Why is a young woman, a girl in her early 20s, rehearsing with two drunk men? I was so scared, I left that place as soon as possible.&quot;</p><p>The actress further alleged that the filmmaker repeatedly knocked on her door at night. Upon opening it, she found him &quot;swaying and asking me for a hug.&quot; Despite her refusal, he &quot;kept slurring and pushing for it.&quot; Bhasker stated she told him he was scaring her, concluding, &quot;I couldn’t do anything more; he’s the director of the film.&quot; Her account has since been circulating on social media.</p><p>What to watch: The broader conversation surrounding safety and professional conduct within the entertainment industry.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft provides a faithful account of the actress's claims as detailed in the source, maintaining the necessary context of her reality show appearance.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/swara-bhasker-recalls-harrowing-experience-with-filmmaker-he-kept-asking-me-for-a-hug/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-02/swara-bhasker-recalls-disturbing-filmmaker-encounter-on-real" data-title="Swara Bhasker Recalls Disturbing Filmmaker Encounter on Reality Show"><b>Share:</b>
