     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · Times of India · 2026-10-02 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Three Suspects Arrested in Greater Faridabad Gang Rape Case</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Authorities have arrested three suspects following the gang rape of a 13-year-old girl and the sexual assault of her friend in Greater Faridabad on Thursday. The victims were intercepted by six youths while returning from tuition classes and taken to an abandoned structure.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/three-suspects-arrested-in-greater-faridabad-gang-rape-case.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The victims initially concealed the assault but later disclosed the event to their families, leading to a formal police complaint. While three individuals are now in custody, three additional suspects remain at large as the investigation continues.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The report is concise, accurate, and includes all relevant facts provided in the source summary.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/faridabad/13-year-old-gang-raped-her-friend-sexually-assaulted-inside-abandoned-faridabad-building-3-held-3-absconding/articleshow/134633064.cms" rel="noopener">Times of India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/faridabad/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Faridabad</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-02/three-suspects-arrested-in-greater-faridabad-gang-rape-case" data-title="Three Suspects Arrested in Greater Faridabad Gang Rape Case"><b>Share:</b>
