       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">EDUCATION</span> · Education (aggregate) · 2026-10-02 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>WB NEET UG 2026: Round 3 Choice Filling Underway</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#NEET UG</span> <span>#Counselling</span> <span>#Admissions</span></div>
       <p>The West Bengal NEET UG 2026 counselling process has commenced its third round of choice filling for aspiring medical students. This crucial stage allows candidates to select their preferred colleges and courses for undergraduate admissions.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/wb-neet-ug-2026-round-3-choice-filling-underway.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Following the completion of the choice filling period, the seat allotment results for Round 3 are scheduled to be released on October 8. Candidates are advised to complete their choices diligently within the stipulated timeframe to ensure consideration for their desired seats.</p><p>What to watch: The official announcement of seat allotment results on October 8.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft is concise and accurately reflects the limited information provided in the source summary.</p>
