       <div class="tags"><span>#Protest</span> <span>#Youth Movement</span> <span>#Election Commission</span></div>
       <p>A group of youth protesters known as the 'Cockroach' collective is set to organize another rally in India. The primary objective of the upcoming demonstration is to demand the removal of the current election chief.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-02/youth-protesters-rally-to-demand-ouster-of-election-chief.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The protest movement, which has gained visibility for its distinct branding, continues to target electoral leadership. The source summary does not specify a date, location, or the specific name of the election chief involved in the demand.</p><p>What to watch: The specific date and location of the next rally, as well as any official response from the electoral authority.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately reflects the limited information provided in the source summary.</p>
